  // Devices whose battery DockHub reads over HID. %AppData%\DockHub\battery-devices.json uses the same format;
  // its entries are added to these and replace an entry with the same protocol, vid and pid.
  // Protocols and fields are described in docs/battery-devices.md.
  //   protocol: hyperx | compx | playstation | razer | hidpp | hidrequest
  //   vid, pid: four hex digits (leave pid out to match every product of the vendor)
  //   name:     shown on the dock; "{pid}" is replaced with the product id
  //   kind:     headset | mouse | keyboard | controller (picks the icon)
  //   id:       optional stable id (lower-case letters, digits, dashes); entries with the same id are one device
  //   wired:    true when this product id means the device is plugged in with its cable (shown as charging)
  //   variant:  playstation: ds4 | dualsense; hidpp: receiver | device
